question: "What should you advise a family member to do if someone has suspected cholera at home?", 
choices: ["Give oral rehydration solution (ORS) and seek medical care", "Give antibiotics without medical advice", "Stop all fluids for 24 hours", "Use herbal remedies only"],
answerIndex: 0,
